        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RKI Florian Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLook closely and you will discover that the Florian Cabinet Pull has a scallop shape that creates a floral design that is timeless. This kitchen cabinet pull is great for those who what something more than traditional cabinet hardware. The Florian Cabinet Pull Series is available as a 96mm cabinet pull, 5 inch cabinet pull, 8 inch cabinet pull, and 10 inch cabinet pull. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:<a href=\"/products/small-florian-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-746\"><b>Matching Florian Cabinet Knob</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/florian-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-8845\"><b>Florian Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-845:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 96mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-846:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-847:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-848:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
